7. SeaDronesSee — open-water human detection dataset
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Authors  : Varga, Kiefer et al., University of Tübingen
Published: IEEE/CVF WACV 2022
Source   : https://github.com/Ben93kie/SeaDronesSee
Licence  : CC0 1.0 Universal (data), MIT (code)
Model    : dronefreak/seadronessee-rfdetr-small (RF-DETR Small, Apache-2.0),
